    {"type":"text","id":"f01_caption","x":120,"y":700,"width":1300,"height":140,"text":"Three columns. Clients on the left talk to the Hono API in the middle. The API is the only sync round-trip surface — it reads/writes Postgres, validates sessions against WorkOS, and calls the LLM proxy directly for text + translation. Long-running work (image gen, PDF extraction) is dispatched to BullMQ; workers consume jobs, call the LLM proxy, write to S3 + Postgres, and publish completion events to Redis. The API's SSE endpoint subscribes to Redis and forwards events to the plugin or admin web. Coral box = the only piece running our code.","originalText":"Three columns. Clients on the left talk to the Hono API in the middle. The API is the only sync round-trip surface — it reads/writes Postgres, validates sessions against WorkOS, and calls the LLM proxy directly for text + translation. Long-running work (image gen, PDF extraction) is dispatched to BullMQ; workers consume jobs, call the LLM proxy, write to S3 + Postgres, and publish completion events to Redis. The API's SSE endpoint subscribes to Redis and forwards events to the plugin or admin web. Coral box = the only piece running our code.","fontSize":14,"fontFamily":3,"textAlign":"left","verticalAlign":"top","strokeColor":"#4a4642","backgroundColor":"transparent","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":1,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":0,"opacity":100,"angle":0,"seed":1071,"version":1,"versionNonce":1072,"isDeleted":false,"groupIds":[],"boundElements":null,"link":null,"locked":false,"containerId":null,"lineHeight":1.5},

