    {"type":"text","id":"f02_caption","x":120,"y":1700,"width":1300,"height":140,"text":"Same call site for copy variants and translation — only the prompt changes. The brand profile is read on every call (not cached client-side) so a published profile change takes effect immediately. The LLM proxy does same-provider retry-with-backoff on transient errors; cross-provider fallback (Claude) lights up in Beta. usage_event row written before the response returns, so the dashboard sees the call even if the plugin closes.","originalText":"Same call site for copy variants and translation — only the prompt changes. The brand profile is read on every call (not cached client-side) so a published profile change takes effect immediately. The LLM proxy does same-provider retry-with-backoff on transient errors; cross-provider fallback (Claude) lights up in Beta. usage_event row written before the response returns, so the dashboard sees the call even if the plugin closes.","fontSize":14,"fontFamily":3,"textAlign":"left","verticalAlign":"top","strokeColor":"#4a4642","backgroundColor":"transparent","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":1,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":0,"opacity":100,"angle":0,"seed":2041,"version":1,"versionNonce":2042,"isDeleted":false,"groupIds":[],"boundElements":null,"link":null,"locked":false,"containerId":null,"lineHeight":1.5},

