    {"type":"text","id":"f03_caption","x":120,"y":2700,"width":1300,"height":140,"text":"Steps 1–2 happen sub-second; the plugin gets a job_id and shows progress. Steps 3–6 are the worker doing the slow part (~10s p95 against gpt-image-2). Step 7's pub/sub event is what makes the architecture scale: the API does not poll, it subscribes. SSE is enough — there is no client-to-server push needed for this flow. If the plugin closes mid-job, the worker still completes and the result is visible in admin web history.","originalText":"Steps 1–2 happen sub-second; the plugin gets a job_id and shows progress. Steps 3–6 are the worker doing the slow part (~10s p95 against gpt-image-2). Step 7's pub/sub event is what makes the architecture scale: the API does not poll, it subscribes. SSE is enough — there is no client-to-server push needed for this flow. If the plugin closes mid-job, the worker still completes and the result is visible in admin web history.","fontSize":14,"fontFamily":3,"textAlign":"left","verticalAlign":"top","strokeColor":"#4a4642","backgroundColor":"transparent","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":1,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":0,"opacity":100,"angle":0,"seed":3059,"version":1,"versionNonce":3060,"isDeleted":false,"groupIds":[],"boundElements":null,"link":null,"locked":false,"containerId":null,"lineHeight":1.5},

