    {"type":"text","id":"f04_caption","x":120,"y":3820,"width":1300,"height":140,"text":"This is the only flow with a mandatory human gate (step 6, coral). Multimodal extraction is good but not flawless on narrow design-only PDFs (Heineken-style). The DRAFT row exists so brand managers can edit before flipping is_current=true. Versioning is built in: every publish increments version; rollback is `UPDATE brand_profile SET is_current=false WHERE …` then flip the previous row back. Eval suite runs against a published profile and can block the flip in Beta+.","originalText":"This is the only flow with a mandatory human gate (step 6, coral). Multimodal extraction is good but not flawless on narrow design-only PDFs (Heineken-style). The DRAFT row exists so brand managers can edit before flipping is_current=true. Versioning is built in: every publish increments version; rollback is `UPDATE brand_profile SET is_current=false WHERE …` then flip the previous row back. Eval suite runs against a published profile and can block the flip in Beta+.","fontSize":14,"fontFamily":3,"textAlign":"left","verticalAlign":"top","strokeColor":"#4a4642","backgroundColor":"transparent","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":1,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":0,"opacity":100,"angle":0,"seed":4047,"version":1,"versionNonce":4048,"isDeleted":false,"groupIds":[],"boundElements":null,"link":null,"locked":false,"containerId":null,"lineHeight":1.5},

