    {"type":"text","id":"f06_panel_a","x":1200,"y":5770,"width":220,"height":80,"text":"WorkOS Roles\nadmin · brand_manager · designer\n\nuser_brand (Postgres)\n(user_id, brand_id) per resource","originalText":"WorkOS Roles\nadmin · brand_manager · designer\n\nuser_brand (Postgres)\n(user_id, brand_id) per resource","fontSize":12,"fontFamily":3,"textAlign":"left","verticalAlign":"top","strokeColor":"#4a4642","backgroundColor":"transparent","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":1,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":0,"opacity":100,"angle":0,"seed":6037,"version":1,"versionNonce":6038,"isDeleted":false,"groupIds":[],"boundElements":null,"link":null,"locked":false,"containerId":null,"lineHeight":1.5},
    {"type":"text","id":"f06_caption","x":120,"y":6000,"width":1300,"height":140,"text":"WorkOS Roles handles the coarse axis (admin / brand_manager / designer). Per-brand access is in our Postgres via user_brand mapping — designers see only the brands they're assigned to. Hybrid is intentional: WorkOS Roles primitive doesn't model per-resource scope. Every router runs the scope check; partial-unique indexes on (org_id, brand_id) act as a backstop. Adversarial tests at Beta exit cover every role × every endpoint × every owned-vs-foreign brand.","originalText":"WorkOS Roles handles the coarse axis (admin / brand_manager / designer). Per-brand access is in our Postgres via user_brand mapping — designers see only the brands they're assigned to. Hybrid is intentional: WorkOS Roles primitive doesn't model per-resource scope. Every router runs the scope check; partial-unique indexes on (org_id, brand_id) act as a backstop. Adversarial tests at Beta exit cover every role × every endpoint × every owned-vs-foreign brand.","fontSize":14,"fontFamily":3,"textAlign":"left","verticalAlign":"top","strokeColor":"#4a4642","backgroundColor":"transparent","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":1,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":0,"opacity":100,"angle":0,"seed":6039,"version":1,"versionNonce":6040,"isDeleted":false,"groupIds":[],"boundElements":null,"link":null,"locked":false,"containerId":null,"lineHeight":1.5},

