    {"type":"text","id":"f07_l_failed","x":820,"y":7060,"width":120,"height":18,"text":"non-recoverable","originalText":"non-recoverable","fontSize":11,"fontFamily":3,"textAlign":"center","verticalAlign":"middle","strokeColor":"#b91c1c","backgroundColor":"transparent","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":1,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":0,"opacity":100,"angle":0,"seed":7047,"version":1,"versionNonce":7048,"isDeleted":false,"groupIds":[],"boundElements":null,"link":null,"locked":false,"containerId":null,"lineHeight":1.25},
    {"type":"text","id":"f07_caption","x":120,"y":7220,"width":1300,"height":140,"text":"Stalled-job recovery: BullMQ scans for stalled jobs every 30s (stalledInterval: 30_000); a job whose Redis lock isn't renewed within that window is returned to the queue. idempotency_key = generation_id ensures retries don't double-write Postgres or S3. Workers are stateless; pod restarts are safe. Final-rollout autoscale: scale up when queue depth > 50, down when < 10 sustained for 5 min. Concurrency knob: 4 jobs/worker (image gen is OpenAI-bound, not CPU-bound — see frame 11).","originalText":"Stalled-job recovery: BullMQ scans for stalled jobs every 30s (stalledInterval: 30_000); a job whose Redis lock isn't renewed within that window is returned to the queue. idempotency_key = generation_id ensures retries don't double-write Postgres or S3. Workers are stateless; pod restarts are safe. Final-rollout autoscale: scale up when queue depth > 50, down when < 10 sustained for 5 min. Concurrency knob: 4 jobs/worker (image gen is OpenAI-bound, not CPU-bound — see frame 11).","fontSize":14,"fontFamily":3,"textAlign":"left","verticalAlign":"top","strokeColor":"#4a4642","backgroundColor":"transparent","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":1,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":0,"opacity":100,"angle":0,"seed":7049,"version":1,"versionNonce":7050,"isDeleted":false,"groupIds":[],"boundElements":null,"link":null,"locked":false,"containerId":null,"lineHeight":1.5},

    {"type":"text","id":"f08_title","x":120,"y":7840,"width":1100,"height":34,"text":"08  ·  Plugin runtime  (two-thread architecture)","originalText":"08  ·  Plugin runtime  (two-thread architecture)","fontSize":28,"fontFamily":3,"textAlign":"left","verticalAlign":"top","strokeColor":"#2a2622","backgroundColor":"transparent","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":1,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":0,"opacity":100,"angle":0,"seed":8001,"version":1,"versionNonce":8002,"isDeleted":false,"groupIds":[],"boundElements":null,"link":null,"locked":false,"containerId":null,"lineHeight":1.25},
    {"type":"text","id":"f08_eyebrow","x":120,"y":7880,"width":1200,"height":20,"text":"Figma constraint · main thread sandboxed (figma global + Figma fetch wrapper) · UI iframe full browser APIs · postMessage bridge","originalText":"Figma constraint · main thread sandboxed (figma global + Figma fetch wrapper) · UI iframe full browser APIs · postMessage bridge","fontSize":13,"fontFamily":3,"textAlign":"left","verticalAlign":"top","strokeColor":"#7e7a74","backgroundColor":"transparent","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":1,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":0,"opacity":100,"angle":0,"seed":8003,"version":1,"versionNonce":8004,"isDeleted":false,"groupIds":[],"boundElements":null,"link":null,"locked":false,"containerId":null,"lineHeight":1.25},
    {"type":"line","id":"f08_rule","x":120,"y":7915,"width":1300,"height":0,"strokeColor":"#cdc9c0","backgroundColor":"transparent","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":1,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":0,"opacity":100,"angle":0,"seed":8005,"version":1,"versionNonce":8006,"isDeleted":false,"groupIds":[],"boundElements":null,"link":null,"locked":false,"points":[[0,0],[1300,0]]},
    {"type":"rectangle","id":"f08_main","x":140,"y":7960,"width":480,"height":300,"strokeColor":"#2a2622","backgroundColor":"#f5f3ed","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":2,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":0,"opacity":100,"angle":0,"seed":8007,"version":1,"versionNonce":8008,"isDeleted":false,"groupIds":[],"boundElements":[{"id":"f08_main_t","type":"text"}],"link":null,"locked":false,"roundness":{"type":3}},
    {"type":"text","id":"f08_main_t","x":160,"y":7980,"width":440,"height":260,"text":"Main thread  (Figma sandbox)\n\n✓  figma.* global API (read/write nodes)\n✓  figma.clientStorage  (async; stability not security)\n✓  figma.loadFontAsync(font)\n✓  figma.createImageAsync(url)  ·  createImage(bytes)\n✓  Figma Fetch API  (manifest-gated)\n✓  setTimeout / setInterval\n✗  no XHR / WebSocket / EventSource / DOM\n\nApply text:\n  loadFontAsync(node.fontName) → node.characters = '...'\n  mixed fonts: walk getRangeFontName + load each\n\nApply image:\n  createImageAsync(signedUrl) → image.hash\n  node.fills = [{ type:'IMAGE', imageHash, scaleMode:'FILL' }]","originalText":"Main thread  (Figma sandbox)\n\n✓  figma.* global API (read/write nodes)\n✓  figma.clientStorage  (async; stability not security)\n✓  figma.loadFontAsync(font)\n✓  figma.createImageAsync(url)  ·  createImage(bytes)\n✓  Figma Fetch API  (manifest-gated)\n✓  setTimeout / setInterval\n✗  no XHR / WebSocket / EventSource / DOM\n\nApply text:\n  loadFontAsync(node.fontName) → node.characters = '...'\n  mixed fonts: walk getRangeFontName + load each\n\nApply image:\n  createImageAsync(signedUrl) → image.hash\n  node.fills = [{ type:'IMAGE', imageHash, scaleMode:'FILL' }]","fontSize":12,"fontFamily":3,"textAlign":"left","verticalAlign":"top","strokeColor":"#2a2622","backgroundColor":"transparent","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":1,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":0,"opacity":100,"angle":0,"seed":8009,"version":1,"versionNonce":8010,"isDeleted":false,"groupIds":[],"boundElements":null,"link":null,"locked":false,"containerId":"f08_main","lineHeight":1.5},
    {"type":"rectangle","id":"f08_ui","x":820,"y":7960,"width":480,"height":300,"strokeColor":"#c25729","backgroundColor":"#f7d6c5","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":2,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":0,"opacity":100,"angle":0,"seed":8011,"version":1,"versionNonce":8012,"isDeleted":false,"groupIds":[],"boundElements":[{"id":"f08_ui_t","type":"text"}],"link":null,"locked":false,"roundness":{"type":3}},
    {"type":"text","id":"f08_ui_t","x":840,"y":7980,"width":440,"height":260,"text":"UI iframe  (full browser)\n\n✓  fetch / EventSource / WebSocket\n✓  full DOM · React render target\n✓  OAuth callback origin handling\n✓  localStorage available (we don't use it)\n✗  no figma.* (must postMessage main)\n\nResponsibilities\n· network calls (POST /generate, SSE)\n· OAuth flow with WorkOS\n· render variants UI\n· postMessage to main on user pick","originalText":"UI iframe  (full browser)\n\n✓  fetch / EventSource / WebSocket\n✓  full DOM · React render target\n✓  OAuth callback origin handling\n✓  localStorage available (we don't use it)\n✗  no figma.* (must postMessage main)\n\nResponsibilities\n· network calls (POST /generate, SSE)\n· OAuth flow with WorkOS\n· render variants UI\n· postMessage to main on user pick","fontSize":13,"fontFamily":3,"textAlign":"left","verticalAlign":"top","strokeColor":"#2a2622","backgroundColor":"transparent","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":1,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":0,"opacity":100,"angle":0,"seed":8013,"version":1,"versionNonce":8014,"isDeleted":false,"groupIds":[],"boundElements":null,"link":null,"locked":false,"containerId":"f08_ui","lineHeight":1.5},
    {"type":"arrow","id":"f08_bridge","x":620,"y":8090,"width":200,"height":0,"strokeColor":"#5a8c7a","backgroundColor":"transparent","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":2,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":0,"opacity":100,"angle":0,"seed":8015,"version":1,"versionNonce":8016,"isDeleted":false,"groupIds":[],"boundElements":null,"link":null,"locked":false,"points":[[0,0],[200,0]],"startBinding":{"elementId":"f08_main","focus":0,"gap":4},"endBinding":{"elementId":"f08_ui","focus":0,"gap":4},"startArrowhead":"arrow","endArrowhead":"arrow"},
    {"type":"text","id":"f08_bridge_l","x":640,"y":8060,"width":160,"height":18,"text":"postMessage  (JSON)","originalText":"postMessage  (JSON)","fontSize":12,"fontFamily":3,"textAlign":"center","verticalAlign":"middle","strokeColor":"#5a8c7a","backgroundColor":"transparent","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":1,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":0,"opacity":100,"angle":0,"seed":8017,"version":1,"versionNonce":8018,"isDeleted":false,"groupIds":[],"boundElements":null,"link":null,"locked":false,"containerId":null,"lineHeight":1.25},
    {"type":"text","id":"f08_caption","x":120,"y":8330,"width":1300,"height":140,"text":"Figma's plugin runtime is two threads, not a webview. The main thread runs in a sandboxed JS context with the figma.* API but no network. The UI iframe is a full-browser iframe with no Figma access. Communication is postMessage only. This shaped the API: bearer-token in clientStorage (main thread persistence), OAuth flow runs in iframe, image fills applied via figma.createImageAsync(signedUrl) on main. Plugin built in week 1 of MVP, in parallel with backend, so integration issues surface early.","originalText":"Figma's plugin runtime is two threads, not a webview. The main thread runs in a sandboxed JS context with the figma.* API but no network. The UI iframe is a full-browser iframe with no Figma access. Communication is postMessage only. This shaped the API: bearer-token in clientStorage (main thread persistence), OAuth flow runs in iframe, image fills applied via figma.createImageAsync(signedUrl) on main. Plugin built in week 1 of MVP, in parallel with backend, so integration issues surface early.","fontSize":14,"fontFamily":3,"textAlign":"left","verticalAlign":"top","strokeColor":"#4a4642","backgroundColor":"transparent","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":1,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":0,"opacity":100,"angle":0,"seed":8019,"version":1,"versionNonce":8020,"isDeleted":false,"groupIds":[],"boundElements":null,"link":null,"locked":false,"containerId":null,"lineHeight":1.5},

