    {"type":"text","id":"f11_pod2_t","x":480,"y":11280,"width":240,"height":140,"text":"Worker pod 2\n\nconcurrency: 4\n8 in-flight jobs total\n\n× 10s p95 per job\n= 0.8 jobs/sec sustained\n= 70k jobs/day at saturation","originalText":"Worker pod 2\n\nconcurrency: 4\n8 in-flight jobs total\n\n× 10s p95 per job\n= 0.8 jobs/sec sustained\n= 70k jobs/day at saturation","fontSize":13,"fontFamily":3,"textAlign":"left","verticalAlign":"top","strokeColor":"#2a2622","backgroundColor":"transparent","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":1,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":0,"opacity":100,"angle":0,"seed":11013,"version":1,"versionNonce":11014,"isDeleted":false,"groupIds":[],"boundElements":null,"link":null,"locked":false,"containerId":"f11_pod2","lineHeight":1.5},
    {"type":"rectangle","id":"f11_retry","x":780,"y":11260,"width":300,"height":180,"strokeColor":"#b8893a","backgroundColor":"#ecdab4","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":2,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":0,"opacity":100,"angle":0,"seed":11015,"version":1,"versionNonce":11016,"isDeleted":false,"groupIds":[],"boundElements":[{"id":"f11_retry_t","type":"text"}],"link":null,"locked":false,"roundness":{"type":3}},
    {"type":"text","id":"f11_retry_t","x":800,"y":11280,"width":260,"height":140,"text":"Retry policy\n\nattempts: 3\nbackoff: exponential, base 1000ms\njitter: 0.5  (BullMQ takes 0..1)\nidempotency_key = generation_id\n\nFails after 3 → row.status='failed'\nSSE failure event → UI","originalText":"Retry policy\n\nattempts: 3\nbackoff: exponential, base 1000ms\njitter: 0.5  (BullMQ takes 0..1)\nidempotency_key = generation_id\n\nFails after 3 → row.status='failed'\nSSE failure event → UI","fontSize":13,"fontFamily":3,"textAlign":"left","verticalAlign":"top","strokeColor":"#2a2622","backgroundColor":"transparent","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":1,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":0,"opacity":100,"angle":0,"seed":11017,"version":1,"versionNonce":11018,"isDeleted":false,"groupIds":[],"boundElements":null,"link":null,"locked":false,"containerId":"f11_retry","lineHeight":1.5},
    {"type":"rectangle","id":"f11_scale","x":1100,"y":11260,"width":280,"height":180,"strokeColor":"#5a8c7a","backgroundColor":"#d6e7df","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":2,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":0,"opacity":100,"angle":0,"seed":11019,"version":1,"versionNonce":11020,"isDeleted":false,"groupIds":[],"boundElements":[{"id":"f11_scale_t","type":"text"}],"link":null,"locked":false,"roundness":{"type":3}},
    {"type":"text","id":"f11_scale_t","x":1120,"y":11280,"width":240,"height":140,"text":"Autoscale (Final Rollout)\n\nscale up if queue depth > 50\nscale down if depth < 10 for 5min\nmin pods: 2 · max pods: 8\n\nFuture: split queues by job type\nper-tenant queue partitions","originalText":"Autoscale (Final Rollout)\n\nscale up if queue depth > 50\nscale down if depth < 10 for 5min\nmin pods: 2 · max pods: 8\n\nFuture: split queues by job type\nper-tenant queue partitions","fontSize":13,"fontFamily":3,"textAlign":"left","verticalAlign":"top","strokeColor":"#2a2622","backgroundColor":"transparent","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":1,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":0,"opacity":100,"angle":0,"seed":11021,"version":1,"versionNonce":11022,"isDeleted":false,"groupIds":[],"boundElements":null,"link":null,"locked":false,"containerId":"f11_scale","lineHeight":1.5},
    {"type":"text","id":"f11_caption","x":120,"y":11500,"width":1300,"height":140,"text":"Image gen is network-bound (waiting on the model ~12s p95 end-to-end), not CPU. Node single-thread + async is fine — no Worker Threads, no threadpool. Concurrency is the rate limit: 4 jobs × 2 pods × 10s ≈ 0.8 jobs/sec sustained ≈ 70k/day at saturation. Realistic MVP demand at 10 designers (≈20–50 image jobs/designer/day) ≈ 200–500/day — the min-pods=2 floor is the binding constraint, not capacity. Stateless workers — pod restarts safe via BullMQ stalled-job recovery. No per-tenant rate-limit middleware needed at MVP; concurrency itself caps load. Limiter (max 50/60s) is dead config given concurrency=4 — kept in spec for Beta where higher concurrency unlocks it.","originalText":"Image gen is network-bound (waiting on the model ~12s p95 end-to-end), not CPU. Node single-thread + async is fine — no Worker Threads, no threadpool. Concurrency is the rate limit: 4 jobs × 2 pods × 10s ≈ 0.8 jobs/sec sustained ≈ 70k/day at saturation. Realistic MVP demand at 10 designers (≈20–50 image jobs/designer/day) ≈ 200–500/day — the min-pods=2 floor is the binding constraint, not capacity. Stateless workers — pod restarts safe via BullMQ stalled-job recovery. No per-tenant rate-limit middleware needed at MVP; concurrency itself caps load. Limiter (max 50/60s) is dead config given concurrency=4 — kept in spec for Beta where higher concurrency unlocks it.","fontSize":14,"fontFamily":3,"textAlign":"left","verticalAlign":"top","strokeColor":"#4a4642","backgroundColor":"transparent","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":1,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":0,"opacity":100,"angle":0,"seed":11023,"version":1,"versionNonce":11024,"isDeleted":false,"groupIds":[],"boundElements":null,"link":null,"locked":false,"containerId":null,"lineHeight":1.5},

