    {"type":"text","id":"f12_caption","x":120,"y":12660,"width":1300,"height":140,"text":"All call sites go through packages/ai. The proxy itself is the unit of versioning — same call site, different routing. MVP: 100% OpenAI, no flag overhead. Beta: PostHog flags swing routing per-feature (e.g. translation → Claude if eval shows better tone preservation; image gen → fal.ai for cost). Fallback only triggers on transient OpenAI errors after the same-provider retry budget is exhausted. Adding fallback chains is editing one config file, not a rewrite — that's the whole point.","originalText":"All call sites go through packages/ai. The proxy itself is the unit of versioning — same call site, different routing. MVP: 100% OpenAI, no flag overhead. Beta: PostHog flags swing routing per-feature (e.g. translation → Claude if eval shows better tone preservation; image gen → fal.ai for cost). Fallback only triggers on transient OpenAI errors after the same-provider retry budget is exhausted. Adding fallback chains is editing one config file, not a rewrite — that's the whole point.","fontSize":14,"fontFamily":3,"textAlign":"left","verticalAlign":"top","strokeColor":"#4a4642","backgroundColor":"transparent","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":1,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":0,"opacity":100,"angle":0,"seed":12041,"version":1,"versionNonce":12042,"isDeleted":false,"groupIds":[],"boundElements":null,"link":null,"locked":false,"containerId":null,"lineHeight":1.5},

