    {"type":"text","id":"f13_ph_t","x":460,"y":13490,"width":300,"height":260,"text":"PostHog\n\n· errors  (replaces Sentry)\n· alerts  (Slack/email routing)\n· session replay  (admin web)\n· feature flags  (per-tenant overrides)\n· product analytics  (funnels, retention)\n· LLM tracing  (prompt, ctx, tokens, cost)\n· LLM evals  (per feature, per profile)\n\nour publish flow polls eval results\nand self-gates the brand-profile flip","originalText":"PostHog\n\n· errors  (replaces Sentry)\n· alerts  (Slack/email routing)\n· session replay  (admin web)\n· feature flags  (per-tenant overrides)\n· product analytics  (funnels, retention)\n· LLM tracing  (prompt, ctx, tokens, cost)\n· LLM evals  (per feature, per profile)\n\nour publish flow polls eval results\nand self-gates the brand-profile flip","fontSize":13,"fontFamily":3,"textAlign":"left","verticalAlign":"top","strokeColor":"#2a2622","backgroundColor":"transparent","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":1,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":0,"opacity":100,"angle":0,"seed":13025,"version":1,"versionNonce":13026,"isDeleted":false,"groupIds":[],"boundElements":null,"link":null,"locked":false,"containerId":"f13_ph","lineHeight":1.5},
