    {"type":"text","id":"f13_caption","x":120,"y":13810,"width":1300,"height":140,"text":"PostHog covers everything off the application data path. Replaces what would otherwise be Sentry + Datadog + LangSmith + LaunchDarkly + Mixpanel. Eval gate (coral diamond) is the load-bearing one — regression in the eval suite blocks the brand-profile is_current=true flip in Beta+. Brand managers see which feature × which profile failed and can override with audit log if eval is wrong. Cost + usage stay in Postgres usage_event for billing accuracy; PostHog supplements with UI funnels.","originalText":"PostHog covers everything off the application data path. Replaces what would otherwise be Sentry + Datadog + LangSmith + LaunchDarkly + Mixpanel. Eval gate (coral diamond) is the load-bearing one — regression in the eval suite blocks the brand-profile is_current=true flip in Beta+. Brand managers see which feature × which profile failed and can override with audit log if eval is wrong. Cost + usage stay in Postgres usage_event for billing accuracy; PostHog supplements with UI funnels.","fontSize":14,"fontFamily":3,"textAlign":"left","verticalAlign":"top","strokeColor":"#4a4642","backgroundColor":"transparent","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":1,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":0,"opacity":100,"angle":0,"seed":13053,"version":1,"versionNonce":13054,"isDeleted":false,"groupIds":[],"boundElements":null,"link":null,"locked":false,"containerId":null,"lineHeight":1.5},

